{"id":"1b0acd8fb565122a","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-prop-lowenheim-skolem.md","title":"Löwenheim–Skolem","display":"prop-lowenheim-skolem — Löwenheim–Skolem","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-lowenheim-skolem","aliases":["58-prop-lowenheim-skolem"],"display":"prop-lowenheim-skolem — Löwenheim–Skolem","depends_on":["[[58-df-first-order-language]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-elementary]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-lowenheim-skolem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-lowenheim-skolem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-lowenheim-skolem — Löwenheim–Skolem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language\">58-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e91c1261e1c2374b\" href=\"?note=e91c1261e1c2374b\" title=\"58-df-elementary\">58-df-elementary</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\mathfrak A,X\\in V\">\\(L,\\mathfrak A,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lowenheim\\text{-}skolem} \\vdash \\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,L)\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A,L)\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)\\land|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)|\\leq\\max\\{|X|,|L|,\\aleph_0\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lowenheim\\text{-}skolem} \\vdash \\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,L)\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A,L)\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)\\land|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)|\\leq\\max\\{|X|,|L|,\\aleph_0\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Downward Löwenheim–Skolem gives an elementary substructure containing any prescribed subset, with the displayed cardinal bound.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary","status":"resolved","id":"e91c1261e1c2374b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\mathfrak A,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Univ}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lowenheim\\text{-}skolem} \\vdash \\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,L)\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathfrak A,L)\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)\\land|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)|\\leq\\max\\{|X|,|L|,\\aleph_0\\}\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1167,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3979","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-prop-lowenheim-skolem.md|58-prop-lowenheim-skolem]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["3888033a846b1cd5","d9b8711cda3f31ca","e91c1261e1c2374b","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}